  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar Partnership Multi Donor Trust Fund Parallel to TF072229</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Trust Fund are to: (a) support Myanmar&#x2019;s transition and the implementation of the Myanmar Government&#x2019;s Framework for Economic and Social Reform and national development plan; (b) enhance cooperation between the Bank and the Donors to the Trust Fund; and (c) improve the resilience and emergency support to vulnerable individuals and households.</narrative>
  </description>
